sequenceDiagram
    participant Engine as smart-paginate-pretext.js
    participant Pretext as Pretext Engine
    participant Playwright as Playwright Browser

    Note over Engine,Pretext: Phase 1: 一次性 Prepare
    Engine->>Pretext: prepare(atoms[0].text, font)
    Engine->>Pretext: prepare(atoms[1].text, font)
    Engine->>Pretext: prepare(atoms[2].text, font)
    Note over Pretext: 缓存所有字形宽度
    Pretext-->>Engine: 返回 handles[]

    Note over Engine,Playwright: Phase 2+3: 逐页预判与验证

    loop 每页
        Note over Engine: --- 预判阶段（纯CPU）---
        Engine->>Engine: startIdx → 逐个累加段落
        
        loop 累加原子段
            Engine->>Pretext: layout(handles[i], 968, 60.8)
            Pretext-->>Engine: { height, lineCount }
            Engine->>Engine: estimated = 88 + 38*N + totalH + 8*brCount
            alt estimated ≤ 1296
                Engine->>Engine: 继续累加
            else estimated > 1296
                Engine->>Engine: 回退一段 → 预测边界 endIdx
            end
        end

        Note over Engine: --- 验证阶段（1次 Playwright）---
        Engine->>Playwright: setContent(HTML[ startIdx..endIdx ])
        Engine->>Playwright: evaluate('document.body.scrollHeight')
        Playwright-->>Engine: scrollHeight

        alt scrollHeight ≤ 1296
            Note over Engine: ✅ 验证通过
        else scrollHeight > 1296
            Note over Engine: ⚠️ Pretext 低估了，回退一段
            Engine->>Playwright: setContent(HTML[ startIdx..endIdx-1 ])
            Playwright-->>Engine: scrollHeight ✅
        end

        Engine->>Engine: 记录 pages [{startIdx, endIdx}]
        Engine->>Engine: startIdx = endIdx + 1
    end
